  cannot be verified from a machine without network access to api.tradera.com. The
  self-test parses this file to prove scripts/xml.js and the Tradera normalizer
  agree on the documented shape.

  Replace it with a REAL captured response as soon as one is available:
      node scripts/build.js --probe --only=tradera
  which writes fixtures/raw-tradera.xml. Then re-run `npm test` — if the real shape
  differs from this guess, the test is where you will find out.
